The "cpp" bundle is the built-in "cpp" extension of Visual Studio Code
(https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/tree/main/extensions/cpp), as IntelliJ IDEA Community ships it in
plugins/textmate/lib/bundles. Visual Studio Code is licensed as follows:

